  "advancements.teyvat_adventures.anemo_resonance.description.1": "被神明命令的自由，也算是一种不自由吧。",
  "advancements.teyvat_adventures.anemo_resonance.description.2": "在高天之处，拿起象征自由的弓，让自己承担一小会的不自由就好",
  "advancements.teyvat_adventures.geo_resonance.description.1": "一切力量皆有其代价，一千种权力伴随着一千种责任",
  "advancements.teyvat_adventures.geo_resonance.description.2": "将最初于意外诞生，而毁坏文明的原初生物归于尘土",
  "advancements.teyvat_adventures.electro_resonance.description.1": "人之在世，却如白露与泡影",
  "advancements.teyvat_adventures.electro_resonance.description.2": "使一个极度坚硬的石头因为雷电而改变",
  "advancements.teyvat_adventures.dendro_resonance.description.1": "明天是否真的会到来，只有身处明天的你才知道",
  "advancements.teyvat_adventures.dendro_resonance.description.2": "拿着草方块睡过一整晚，自然醒来时它会变成你的共鸣",
  "advancements.teyvat_adventures.hydro_resonance.description.1": "命运虽有既定的重点，但正义却会在苦难中开出花来",
  "advancements.teyvat_adventures.hydro_resonance.description.2": "即使是水也有平凡的，在下雨天把平凡的药水投入装水的炼药锅吧",
  "advancements.teyvat_adventures.pyro_resonance.description.1": "无论何等渺小的火星，也终将被人注视",
  "advancements.teyvat_adventures.pyro_resonance.description.2": "承受着烈火，见证赤铁的战友战至最后一刻",
